# NAME: cTrader
# TYPE: program
# REPO: https://github.com/kevshen13/surge-rules
# UPDATED: 2026-11-13
# ROUTING: Choose an independent policy for each list; app and feed exits need not match.
# ORDER: Place data-source DOMAIN/IP rules before program PROCESS-NAME rules.
# GATEWAY: PROCESS-NAME identifies only processes on the Surge host, not remote LAN PCs.
# SOURCE: https://help.ctrader.com/
# NOTE: Broker/feed destinations are handled by their own earlier rules; this list is the program/site fallback.

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ctrader.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,spotware.com

# Official Pepperstone web client references config/assets on these domains.
# Source: https://ct.pepperstone.com/
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ctradercloud.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ctwebcloud.com
# Observed Windows cTrader Algo/platform hub; keep it with the app policy.
DOMAIN,hublive.spotware.ia.spotwa.re
PROCESS-NAME,cTrader
